# Hugging Face Model Summary

## Model Name
DistilBERT base uncased fine-tuned on SST-2

## Model Purpose
Used for English sentiment classification.

## Supported Task
Text Classification / Sentiment Analysis

## Input Format
Text sentence or review.

Example:
"Movie was amazing."

## Output Format
Sentiment label and confidence score.

Example:
POSITIVE
Confidence: 0.99

## Real-World Applications
- Movie review analysis
- Product review analysis
- Customer feedback analysis
- Social media sentiment analysis

## Comparison with Day 9
Day 9 used TF-IDF with Logistic Regression.
Day 10 uses a pre-trained Transformer model.

## Conclusion
The Hugging Face model allows sentiment prediction without
training a new model from scratch.
